From: Mate Molnar <matemolnar88@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 13:30:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] pvr: render target macrotile geometry for simple parameter format v1

pvr_arch_rt_mtile_info_init() asserted simple_parameter_format_version 2
and set up 16 macrotiles of 2x2 tiles. Version 1 cores (GE8300) use one
macrotile covering the whole render target, so region header, tail pointer
and macrotile stride sizes derive from the full tile count (vendor DDK 1.9
RGXAddRenderTarget: TE_MTILE1 = tiles_x << 18, TE_SCREEN = tiles - 1,
region headers 5 bytes per tile, TPC 8 * pow2(max tiles)^2).
---
--- a/src/imagination/vulkan/pvr_arch_job_render.c
+++ b/src/imagination/vulkan/pvr_arch_job_render.c
@@ -127,7 +127,22 @@
 
    rogue_get_num_macrotiles_xy(dev_info, &info->mtiles_x, &info->mtiles_y);
 
-   if (PVR_HAS_FEATURE(dev_info, simple_internal_parameter_format)) {
+   if (PVR_HAS_FEATURE(dev_info, simple_internal_parameter_format) &&
+       PVR_GET_FEATURE_VALUE(dev_info, simple_parameter_format_version, 0) ==
+          1) {
+      /* Version 1 (Series8XE, e.g. GE8300): one macrotile covering the whole
+       * render target, no tile grouping (vendor DDK RGXAddRenderTarget for
+       * 22.40.54.30).
+       */
+      info->mtile_x1 = info->num_tiles_x;
+      info->mtile_y1 = info->num_tiles_y;
+      info->mtile_x2 = 0;
+      info->mtile_y2 = 0;
+      info->mtile_x3 = 0;
+      info->mtile_y3 = 0;
+      info->x_tile_max = info->num_tiles_x - 1;
+      info->y_tile_max = info->num_tiles_y - 1;
+   } else if (PVR_HAS_FEATURE(dev_info, simple_internal_parameter_format)) {
       assert(PVR_GET_FEATURE_VALUE(dev_info,
                                    simple_parameter_format_version,
                                    0) == 2);
